===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[Ebola]] [[fever]]|-}}

# {{disease}} An extremely contagious and often fatal illness caused by the [[Ebola virus]], characterised by [[fever]] and internal bleeding, contracted through infected body fluids.

